 "reading": "Arrivals follow a summer season (July is 43% above an average month) on a trend of about 7% a year, and three months stand apart from it: October 2024 and October 2025, each about 29% above the seasonal baseline, and February 2025, 18% above; no other month is more than 5% from the baseline. The chart shows that the festival months had roughly 12,000 to 21,000 more arrivals than season and trend predict, not that the festivals caused them or that those visitors would not have come in another month.",
